Third-party material bundled with this package
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

None. This package contains no schema, no table, no corpus and no vendored
text of any kind — it is a reader with no dependencies, and the only file it
ships besides its own source is this notice and the licence beside it.

The material the sibling package `vdi2770-validate` bundles — VDI's XML schema,
the IDTA document class table, the reference implementation's corpus — is
accounted for in that package's NOTICE and THIRD_PARTY.md, and none of it is
here.

The text of the VDI 2770 guideline itself (VDI 2770 Blatt 1:2020-04) is sold by
DIN Media and is NOT included, quoted, or paraphrased anywhere in this project.
